; ==============================================================
; XAUUSD H1 AUTO DIRECTOR — lets the market pick the engine
; Regime -> engine: Trending -> Swing/ZoneSniper/Sniper, Ranging ->
; ZoneSniper/MeanReversion, Transition -> Scalper, High-Vol -> stand down.
; REQUIRES: news bridge running (mt5_bridge.py) for the news filter.
; Attach to XAUUSD H1 chart.
; ==============================================================
InpAutoStrategy=true||0||0||0||N
InpSignalTimeframe=H1||0||0||0||N
InpPositionMode=1||0||0||0||N
InpSelMinRegimeConfidence=60||0||0||0||N
InpSelMinDwellMin=30||0||0||0||N
InpStrategyType=0||0||0||0||N
InpRiskPercent=1.0||0||0||0||N
InpMaxOpenTrades=3||0||0||0||N
InpMinScore=80||0||0||0||N
InpMaxSpreadPoints=300||0||0||0||N
InpUseNewsFilter=true||0||0||0||N
InpUseLossStreakCooldown=true||0||0||0||N
InpLossStreakThreshold=3||0||0||0||N
InpLossStreakCooldownMin=60||0||0||0||N
InpMaxDailyLossPct=3.0||0||0||0||N
InpMaxDrawdownPct=10.0||0||0||0||N
		